# A Macintosh has no PC parallel port.  On the Network Server, initldev's
# parallel loadable device (libldpar.so) probes ports $3BC-$3BE, finds
# nothing, and then blocks for good in LD_InitPhysical, right after
# "LD_InitPhysical: Before AddNodes".  That stalls the rest of the boot.
# Drop it from initldev's argument list.
file /BOOT.SCI
comment-line 'PN_FILE_ARGV="libldpar.so"'
